activity Requisition Apparatus
activity Authorize Requisition
activity Purchase Apparatus
activity Accept Apparatus
activity Examine Apparatus
activity Set up Apparatus
activity Educate Personnel
activity Operate Apparatus
activity Service Apparatus
activity Retire Apparatus
bind Requisition Apparatus: Requisition Identifier
bind Authorize Requisition: Authorization State
bind Purchase Apparatus: Apparatus Price
bind Examine Apparatus: Apparatus State, Examination Rating
bind Educate Personnel: Instruction Duration
bind Set up Apparatus: Setup State
bind Service Apparatus: Servicing State
bind Retire Apparatus: Retire Cause
bind Operate Apparatus: Utilization Rate
Requisition Identifier: integer between 1 and 10000
Apparatus Price: float between 100.0 and 100000.0
Authorization State: Pending, Accepted, Rejected
Apparatus State: New, Good, Broken
Instruction Duration: integer between 1 and 40
Setup State: Not Started, In Progress, Finished
Servicing State: Current, Due, Overdue
Utilization Rate: integer between 0 and 100
Retire Cause: Outdated, Faulty, Replaced
Examination Rating: float between 0.0 and 10.0
Init[Requisition Apparatus] | |
End[Retire Apparatus] | |
Existence[Examine Apparatus] | |
Absence[Requisition Apparatus] | |
Precedence[Purchase Apparatus, Authorize Requisition] | |A.Authorization State is Accepted |
Chain Response[Accept Apparatus, Examine Apparatus] | | |0,2,d
Response[Set up Apparatus, Educate Personnel] |A.Setup State is Finished | |
Precedence[Operate Apparatus, Educate Personnel] | | |
Precedence[Operate Apparatus, Service Apparatus] | |T.Servicing State is Current |
Not Chain Succession[Operate Apparatus, Retire Apparatus] | | |
Responded Existence[Examine Apparatus, Retire Apparatus] |A.Apparatus State is Broken | |
Precedence[Purchase Apparatus, Authorize Requisition] |A.Apparatus Price > 1000 |T.Authorization State is Accepted |
Chain Response[Operate Apparatus, Service Apparatus] | | |0,30,d
Precedence[Set up Apparatus, Examine Apparatus] | | |
Responded Existence[Retire Apparatus, Examine Apparatus] |A.Retire Cause is Outdated | |